{"version":1,"content":"<p>如果哥幾個家裏剛好有猴子養殖場，又碰巧養的是食蟹猴。那你算是趕上好時候了。是這樣的，世超最近發現國內實驗猴的價格往上躥得厲害，<strong>部分高規格食蟹猴的報價已經來到了 25 萬—26 萬元/只。</strong>而且不光是貴，這玩意兒你現在有錢都不一定買得到。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1586382.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:21:27.168126+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:58:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_hash":"c20b63d0237797b2b81569b8f1b5d1209496102de97de60042113a4aab2850b8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}